RaftReplicationService không cần thay đổi cho D15.
No defect was found in RaftReplicationService, AppendEntriesHandler,
ReplicationTracker, AppendRetryCoordinator, RaftTransportAdapter,
LeaderHeartbeatScheduler, RaftState or PersistentRaftNode while writing
