Environment:
- Host: Windows; Docker Engine 29.8.0.
- Test container: maven:3.9-eclipse-temurin-25; OpenJDK 25.0.4.1; Maven 3.9.16.
- Network: railway-dev-network.
- No PostgreSQL, TCP socket, Docker node, or real sleep/scheduler is used by
  this test class. Storage is FakeRaftStorage; RPC is an in-memory FakeNetwork;
  retry scheduling and heartbeats are driven manually by the test.

